stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Created: pthread_create()
    
    Created --> Ready: Scheduled by kernel
    
    Ready --> Running: Assigned to CPU
    
    Running --> Ready: Preempted (time slice expired)
    Running --> Waiting: Blocked on I/O, mutex, cond var
    Running --> Terminated: return from thread function
    
    Waiting --> Ready: Resource available, mutex unlocked
    
    Terminated --> [*]: pthread_join() or detached
    
    note right of Created
        New thread created
        Not yet scheduled
    end note
    
    note right of Running
        Executing on CPU
        Can be preempted
    end note
    
    note right of Waiting
        Blocked:
        - pthread_mutex_lock() waiting
        - pthread_cond_wait() waiting
        - read()/write() blocking I/O
    end note
    
    note right of Terminated
        Zombie until joined
        or created detached
    end note
